**Choices I made**
- Probe-inside-geometry is not detected. Alpha-masked triangles are treated as opaque for this pass (`FORCE_OPAQUE`).
- The sky is uniform, and the sun has no lobe.

The progress log has the full entry under `US-044`. The design is in `docs/dynamic-gi.md`.
